@startuml textbook-state-gof
title State Pattern - GoF Reference Structure\n(Source: Gamma, Helm, Johnson, Vlissides. Design Patterns. Addison-Wesley, 1995)
top to bottom direction
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam classBorderThickness 1.2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
hide empty members
hide circle

class Context <<Context>> #FFD0D0 {
  +request()
}
interface State <<State>> {
  +handle()
}
class ConcreteStateA
class ConcreteStateB

Context --> "current" State
State <|.. ConcreteStateA
State <|.. ConcreteStateB

note right of Context
  Delegates request to current State.
  Behavior changes when State changes.
end note
@enduml
